lip.\nTheir https://t.co/hYEtZsXUgl", "url": "https://x.com/TwilightSignals/status/2113017485708464529"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2113224585332043777"]}, "author_id": "2073074194112237568", "created_at": "2026-10-22T11:02:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113224590658785370"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/6eak4HuUAv", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/VestigiaLabs/status/2113224590658785370/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2113224585332043777", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/6eak4HuUAv"}]}, "id": "2113224590658785370", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 97, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "DEEPSEEK DATA IMPLIES 82% GROSS PROFIT MARGIN\n\nDeepSeek open-sourced its production-grade inference engine, **DeepInfer**, disclosing serving throughput figures that imply an approximate 82% hardware-level gross profit margin under commercial GPU rental rates.\n\nKey Verified https://t.co/6eak4HuUAv", "url": "https://x.com/VestigiaLabs/status/2113224590658785370"}, {"author_id": "2079125403114061824", "created_at": "2026-10-22T23:30:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2113412603946950810"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/NVIDIARobotics…", "end": 294, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/NVIDIARobotics/status/2113407332747293131", "start": 271, "url": "https://t.co/KvJln9n3CW"}]}, "id": "2113412603946950810", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113407332747293131", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📢 The sim-to-real gap is where robot learning usually stalls — Isaac Lab 3.0 is NVIDIA betting the fix is workflow, not just a bigger model.\n\nNVIDIA says Isaac Lab 3.0 is officially out, with:\n• A new modular, lightweight architecture\n• Multi-physics and multi-rendering https://t.co/KvJln9n3CW", "url": "https://x.com/poweredb